#: flowview_filters.php
msgid "Materialization pre-computes the results of a Filter for each flow partition, with NAT on and off, and stores them in the Parallel Query cache, so reports over older data open quickly.  New partitions are materialized automatically once they stop receiving flows.  Required means partitions that have rotated are not materialized yet, Running means a materialization is in progress, and Up to date means every rotated partition is materialized.  Running: N is how many queries of the Filter are working now.  The partition still receiving flows is not materialized, so it does not count."
msgstr "Ukuveliswa kubala kwangaphambili iziphumo zeSihluzi kwicandelo ngalinye lokuhamba, xa i-NAT ivuliwe naxa icinyiwe, kwaye kuzigcine kwi-cache ye-Parallel Query, ukuze iingxelo zedatha endala zivuleke ngokukhawuleza.  Amacandelo amatsha aveliswa ngokuzenzekelayo xa eyeka ukufumana ukuhamba.  Okufunekayo kuthetha ukuba amacandelo ajikelezisiweyo akakaveliswa okwangoku, Ukusebenza kuthetha ukuba ukuveliswa kuyaqhubeka, kwaye Kuhlaziyiwe kuthetha ukuba lonke icandelo elijikelezisiweyo livelisiwe.  Ukusebenza: N libonisa ukuba mingaphi imibuzo yeSihluzi esebenzayo ngoku.  Icandelo elisafumana ukuhamba aliveliswa, ngoko alibalwa."

