#: setup.php
msgid "Provide the IPv4 ip address range for your local network for hosts that may not be registered in DNS.  These hosts will be mapped to the Local Domain Name above.  This more for home users.  You can use either CIDR or non-CIDR formats.  For example: 192.168.11.0 or 192.168.11.0/24"
msgstr "Nika uluhlu lweedilesi ze-IP ze-IPv4 zothungelwano lwakho lwasekhaya kwiihosti ezinokungabhaliswa kwi-DNS. Ezi hosti ziya kubotshelelwa kwiGama leDomain yaseKhaya engasentla. Oku kwenzelwe ngakumbi abasebenzisi basekhaya. Ungasebenzisa iifomathi ze-CIDR okanye ezingezizo eze-CIDR. Umzekelo: 192.168.11.0 okanye 192.168.11.0/24"

#: setup.php
