#: setup.php
msgid "Use Arin to find Domains and AS Numbers"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-Arin ukufumana ii-Domain kunye neeNombolo ze-AS"

#: setup.php
msgid "Many Big Tech data collection services like to mask their ownership of domains to obfuscate the fact that they are collecting your personal information.  If you are concerned with this and your Cacti install has access to the Internet, you can use Arin to remove the mask from those Big Tech companies."
msgstr "Iinkonzo ezininzi zokuqokelela idatha ze-Big Tech ziyathanda ukufihla ubunini bazo bee-domain ukuze zifihle into yokuba ziqokelela iinkcukacha zakho zobuqu. Ukuba oku kuyakukhathaza kwaye ukufakelwa kwakho kwe-Cacti kufikelela kwi-Intanethi, ungasebenzisa i-Arin ukususa isigqubuthelo kwezo nkampani ze-Big Tech."

