#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Queries"
msgstr "Imibuzo eHambelanayo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Parallel Query Backend"
msgstr "I-Backend yeMibuzo eHambelanayo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how parallel FlowView queries are executed.  The Legacy PHP Runner forks the flowview_runner.php process per query and shard.  The FlowView Query Service dispatches the same map-reduce work to a long-running Go service over localhost, avoiding per-query process startup and database polling latency.  Requires the flowview-query service (see plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) to be installed and running."
msgstr "Khetha indlela imibuzo ye-FlowView ehamba ngaxeshanye ephunyezwa ngayo. I-Legacy PHP Runner yahlula inkqubo ye-flowview_runner.php ngombuzo ngamnye kunye ne-shard. I-FlowView Query Service ithumela kwa lo msebenzi we-map-reduce kwinkonzo ye-Go esebenza ixesha elide nge-localhost, ithintela ukulibaziseka kokuqalisa inkqubo ngombuzo kunye nokujonga isiseko sedatha. Ifuna inkonzo ye-flowview-query (jonga i-plugins/flowview/service/flowview-query) ukuba ifakwe kwaye isebenze."

#: setup.php
msgid "Legacy PHP Runner"
msgstr "Isiphumezi se-PHP sakudala"

#: setup.php
msgid "FlowView Query Service"
msgstr "Inkonzo yeMibuzo ye-FlowView"

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service URL"
msgstr "I-URL yeNkonzo yoMbuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Base URL of the FlowView Query Service, for example http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Leave blank to auto-discover the ephemeral port from the service's port file."
msgstr "I-URL esisiseko yeNkonzo yoMbuzo ye-FlowView, umzekelo http://127.0.0.1:8699.  Shiya ingenanto ukuze ufumanise ngokuzenzekelayo izibuko lexeshana kwifayile yezibuko yenkonzo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Port File"
msgstr "Ifayile ye-Port yeNkonzo yoMbuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Path to the port file the FlowView Query Service writes its bound address to.  Used to discover the service endpoint when the Query Service URL above is blank."
msgstr "Indlela eya kwifayile ye-port apho iNkonzo yeMibuzo ye-FlowView ibhala idilesi yayo ebophelelekileyo.  Isetyenziselwa ukufumanisa indawo yokugqibela yenkonzo xa i-URL yeNkonzo yeMibuzo engentla ingenanto."

#: setup.php
msgid "Query Service Token"
msgstr "Ithokheni yeNkonzo yoMbuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Optional shared secret.  When set, Cacti sends it to the FlowView Query Service as an \"Authorization: Bearer\" header and the service rejects any state-changing request that does not present the same token.  Set the matching value in the service's config file (auth_token) or the FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN environment variable.  Recommended whenever the service is reachable by anything other than trusted local processes."
msgstr "Imfihlo ekwabelwana ngayo ekhethwayo.  Xa imiselwe, i-Cacti iyithumela kwiNkonzo yoMbuzo ye-FlowView njengentloko ye-\"Authorization: Bearer\" kwaye inkonzo iyala nasiphi na isicelo esitshintsha isimo esingabonisi thokheni ifanayo.  Misela ixabiso elihambelanayo kwifayile yoqwalaselo yenkonzo (auth_token) okanye kwiguquguquki yendawo ye-FLOWVIEW_QUERY_TOKEN.  Iyacetyiswa nanini na xa inkonzo ifikeleleka nantoni na ngaphandle kweenkqubo zendawo ezithembekileyo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Max Concurrent Threads"
msgstr "Ubuninzi bee-Thread eziSebenza ngaxeshanye"

#: setup.php
msgid "The maximum number of threads that will be dispatched to run the FlowView queries.  Note that you can have at most 1 thread per database partition, and you should be careful not to overload your database server with having too many concurrent threads running."
msgstr "Elona nani liphezulu lemisonto (threads) eya kuthunyelwa ukuqhuba imibuzo ye-FlowView.  Qaphela ukuba unokuba nomsonto oyi-1 ngokwesahlulo sesiseko sedatha ngasinye ubuninzi, kwaye kufuneka ulumke ukuba ungayithwali kakhulu iseva yakho yesiseko sedatha ngokuba nemisonto emininzi kakhulu esebenza ngaxeshanye."

#: setup.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Icinyiwe"

#: setup.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Threads"
msgstr "%d ii-Thread"

#: setup.php
msgid "Maximum Run Time"
msgstr "Elona Xesha liPhezulu lokuSebenza"

#: setup.php
msgid "If the Parallel Query does not finish in this time, exit."
msgstr "Ukuba uMbuzo oHambelanayo awugqibi ngeli xesha, phuma."

#: setup.php
msgid "Cached Data Time to Live"
msgstr "Ixesha loBomi beDatha eGciniweyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "How long should FlowView hold onto Cached Query results before purging them?"
msgstr "I-FlowView mayibambe ixesha elingakanani iziphumo ze-Cached Query phambi kokuzicima?"

#: setup.php
