msgstr "Iintsuku ezi-%d"

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Sharding"
msgstr "Ukwahlulwa kwedatha ye-MaxScale (Sharding)"

#: setup.php
msgid "This is only required if your Cacti System's Flowview Database connection is not already using a MaxScale enabled Read-Write Split port."
msgstr "Oku kufuneka kuphela ukuba uqhagamshelwano lweDathabheyisi ye-Flowview yeNkqubo yakho yeCacti alukasebenzisi i-port ye-Read-Write Split evuliweyo ye-MaxScale."

#: setup.php
msgid "Leverage MaxScale to Distribute Query Shards"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-MaxScale ukusasaza iziqhekeza zemibuzo"

#: setup.php
msgid "If you have multiple service acting as slaves for MaxScale, you can increase the speed of querying by distributing the parallel queries to multiple MariaDB backend servers."
msgstr "Ukuba uneenkonzo ezininzi ezisebenza njengama-slaves e-MaxScale, unokwandisa isantya sokubuza ngokusasaza imibuzo ehambelanayo kwiiseva ezingasemva ezininzi ze-MariaDB."

#: setup.php
msgid "MaxScale Read-Write Split Port"
msgstr "Iphothi yoKwahlula ukuFunda nokuBhala ye-MaxScale"

#: setup.php
msgid "This should be the port of the Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) service and router."
msgstr "Eli kufuneka kube lizibuko lenkonzo ye-Read-Write-Split-Service (readwrite) kunye nerutha."

